rld is completely open the more we  explore the more missions we find and  the more battles we undertake  and the tactical nature of battles is an  area which saw great praise in the  reviews back in 2019.  it's even possible to pause mid-fight to  analyze the battlefield for the best  course of action  overall what do you think a pretty good  lineup i reckon the next time we meet up  we'll have a brand new game to talk  about which is going straight into ps  plus in february  more on that soon and remember ps plus  gives you more than the free games each  month  ps plus opens the multiplayer portion of  many games  including destiny 2 hey segway destiny 2  on ps5 revamps the game with 120 frames  per second in pvp matches  and 4k 60fps support elsewhere  you can pick up the base game for free  in the psn store right now and  should you like it there is a massive  discount on the latest expansion beyond  light  and many other dlcs too there's a link  in the description if you want it i also  made a video breaking down  everything you need to know and it's on  screen right now look at it  thank you bunji for sponsoring this ps  plus update and thank you for watching  i'm adam from playstation grenade it's  been a pleasure all the best for 2021  see ya

